## Chromium third-party code and build tools

Chromium's dependency graph includes components with separate licensing terms.
Its DEPS, third_party component metadata, LICENSE files, generated credits, and
build-time license tools must be evaluated at the pinned revision. Do not treat
the root Chromium BSD notice as the license for all Chromium dependencies.

depot_tools is obtained from:
https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/tools/depot_tools.git
Its own LICENSE and dependency notices apply; it is a build tool, not an OpenArc
authored component. A browser distribution must distinguish shipped code from
tools used only during the build.

